Package: kora-soplos-icons
Version: 1.0.0-3
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: breeze-icon-theme
Maintainer: Sergi Perich <info@soploslinux.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/SoplosLinux/kora-soplos-icons
Description: Kora Soplos icon themes (dark and light) for Soplos Linux.
 Icon themes for Soplos Linux based on the Kora icon theme and recolored
 with the official Soplos palette. Two variants are installed in
 /usr/share/icons: Kora Soplos Dark and Kora Soplos Light.
 .
 Based on Kora (https://github.com/bikass/kora). Soplos modifications by
 Sergi Perich and Simnandez.
 Build date: 2026-10-25
